  "question": {
    "text": "Light is incident normally on a completely absorbing surface with an energy flux of <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> . If the surface has an area of <math><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> , the momentum transferred to the surface in <math> <mrow> <mtext>40</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>min</mtext></mrow> </math> time duration will be:"
