  "solution": {
    "text": "The power of the incident light is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>625</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math><br />Energy incident per second, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>625</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br />Momentum incident per second, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>625</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Total momentum transferred to the surface&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>625</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>60</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>"
